		{"type":"text","text":"##  2. Engage Networks\nIdentify projects working on the ground in different (bio)regions and verticals that align with hypotheses on the Metacrisis solution space.","id":"b1840c9b411c1385","x":265,"y":920,"width":480,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"##  4. Develop Knowledge\nLearn what works from projects on the ground in order to develop hypotheses further and disseminate learnings across the network.","id":"5d1926aa42899fa6","x":-365,"y":1160,"width":480,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"# Metaforge Activities","id":"d409e8df62d3d9c0","x":-365,"y":820,"width":480,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"type":"text","text":"##  1. Form Hypotheses\nForm hypotheses around the Metacrisis solution space: what do we need to be doing in order to address the Metacrisis holistically?","id":"3c4e9afe7e53ebb2","x":-365,"y":920,"width":480,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"ReFiDAO","id":"0b3bdbbf994b6520","x":189,"y":2052,"width":123,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"FlorestaTV","id":"06b4b585f5f1971c","x":2,"y":1752,"width":148,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"JournoDAO","id":"66441133200d5ff4","x":-180,"y":1732,"width":150,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"## 3. Implement Responses\nHarness expertise and resources to support projects in implementing technologies and coordination mechanisms that support regeneration efforts.","id":"b5f45dc65ee7d240","x":265,"y":1160,"width":480,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"Indigenous Sovereignty","id":"0c6937e955ff7d5a","x":3340,"y":240,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"type":"text","text":"Communal Land & Infrastructure Ownership","id":"083603cd975cc4c0","x":3530,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"type":"text","text":"##  1. Signals & Sensemaking\n**Core Objectives**  \n1. Collect signals relating to the Metacrisis\n 2. Synthesize data through communal sensemaking  \n 3. Maintain database of problem & solution spaces\n 4. Engage in future design & world-building on a local (bioregional) level\n\n**Harness**  \nDigital & on-the-ground communities\nSubject-matter experts: Daniel S, Hanzi Freinacht, metacrisis.xyz members\nProcesses and methods created by: [Radar DAO](https://www.radardao.xyz/), [Radicle Civics](https://radiclecivics.cc/), [Dark Matter Labs](https://darkmatterlabs.org/Projects), [Civil Society Foresight Observatory](https://www.careful.industries/foresight-observatory/discovery-report) Foresight Commons ","id":"240916749df242d8","x":880,"y":-530,"width":480,"height":460,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"##  5. Infrastructure & Initiatives\n**Core Objectives**  \n1. Ideate missing digital/physical infrastructure on a local or glocal level, including products, services, research initiatives\n2. Launch and iterate on project experiments\n3. Generate impact & re-invest profits (in all forms of capital: financial, knowledge, human resources etc)\n\n**Harness**  \nLocal knowledge, community skills, pre-existing local coordination infrastructure ie. governments, businesses etc.","id":"777c4addc33fd500","x":460,"y":50,"width":540,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"##  2. Content & Events\n**Core Objectives** \n1. Create and distribute content that informs & educates about the Metacrisis, particularly around solution spaces. This can include articles, videos, podcasts, infographics, social media posts & more.\n2. Organize learning events & participatory workshops\n\n**Harness**  \nPre-existing content and content creators such as: Green Pill Podcasts, [Reforge The Ring](https://paragraph.xyz/@reforgethering), https://metacrisis.org/, [Emerging](https://www.whatisemerging.com/) etc.\nPopular mass communication formats: [Kursgesagt](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsXVk37bltHxD1rDPwtNM8Q), [Intersectional Environmentalist](https://www.instagram.com/intersectionalenvironmentalist/)","id":"1e4768d9742a6ef5","x":220,"y":-740,"width":580,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"## 3. Community\n**Core Objectives**  \n1. Catalyze & support local (bioregional) hubs\n3. Engage diverse projects & people within ecosystems, both in- & outside of web3\n\n**Harness**  \nGreenPill, RegenDAO & RadicalXChange local hubs for action","id":"8d18e993976a8e3e","x":-420,"y":-440,"width":500,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"type":"text","text":"##  4. Funding\n**Core Objectives**  \n1. Increase number of individuals involved in Gitcoin Metacrisis funding rounds\n2. Secure funds from org and private cos for Gitcoin funding rounds or non-quadratic grants\n3. Generate income through sales of content, NFTs, infrastructure & initiatives or other methods\n4. Create investment fund for Metacrisis projects\n\n**Harness**  \nGitcoin, existing funders & grants, community capital.","id":"be00f1f79f6c71e4","x":-560,"y":40,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"6"},
